TITLE: Size limit
STATEMENT: >>>
`run_analysis` raises `ValueError` "Log is N MB; the limit is M MB." when the size of `ulog_path` on disk
divided by 1 000 000 is above `FLIGHTMD_MAX_LOG_MB` (default 512), before hashing or opening the file, and
passes `int(limit * 1e6)` to `_open_and_parse` as `max_bytes`. The `file_size` argument takes no part in this
check.
<<<
