[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-INT-042
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Progress wrapper
STATEMENT: >>>
The inner `progress(pct, msg, eta_s)` of `run_analysis` drops a call whose `pct` is below the highest already
sent. Otherwise it calls `progress_callback(pct, msg, eta)` with `eta` `None` or rounded to 1 decimal, awaits
the result when it is awaitable, logs and swallows any `Exception` from the callback, and logs the step. With no
callback it only logs.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: intake
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
