STATEMENT: >>>
When `estimator_status` has `timestamp` and both wind columns (`wind_vel_n` or `wind[0]`, and `wind_vel_e` or
`wind[1]`), `_fill_path` sets `metadata.gps_path_wind_speed_ms` to the horizontal wind speed (m/s) of the
estimator row nearest in time to each path point, `None` where it is not finite. No limit is put on how far
apart in time the two rows are. Otherwise the field is left unset.
<<<
