[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-INT-055
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Running the analysers
STATEMENT: >>>
After the metadata steps `run_analysis` calls `load_analysers(metadata=metadata)`, runs `safe_analyse(topics,
params)` of each analyser whose `missing_inputs(topics)` is `None` in the default thread pool, all at once,
and collects the results with `asyncio.gather` in the order of the analyser list, not of completion. It then
appends `skip_result(topics)` of each remaining analyser in list order, and builds the findings list by
concatenating the results' findings in that order.
<<<
